#! solo --size 140x40 --faux scripts/proof/tui_see/question.jsonl
# The same question on a wide screen: the highlighted option's preview sits in a pane beside the tiles.
wait-frame 5000 faux-1
tick 1
type lay out the plan pane
key enter
wait-frame 30000 Which layout for the plan pane?
snap card
key down
snap preview
key 2
wait-frame 30000 Composing
tick 8000
wait-idle 30000
snap answered
quit
